  infoTexts:
  - Health Bar
  - An elegant and unusual weapon, the Feather Cannon fires giant, colorful feathers
    that stun enemies with softness, followed by a powerful shockwave. Perfect for
    distracting and disorienting foes.
  - The Artillery Poulalier is a sturdy tower equipped with a powerful cannon. It
    fires explosive projectiles at long range, dealing heavy damage to enemy waves
    while slowing their progress. Perfect for controlling strategic areas and breaking
    enemy formations.
